{
  "Title": "ELSA-2026-500648: nginx:1.26 security update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "[1.26.3-10.0.2.1]\n- Fix resolver use-after-free (CVE-2026-123634)\n- Fix mail proxy use-after-free (CVE-2026-113425)\n- Fix HTTP/2 flow-control memory corruption (CVE-2026-123007)\n- Fix HTTP/2 connection reuse use-after-free (CVE-2026-123633)\n\n[1.26.3-10.0.1.1]\n- Require oracle-indexhtml\n\n[2:1.26.3-12]\n- Fixes CVE-2026-97205 and CVE-2026-15176\n\n[2:1.26.3-11]\n- Fixes CVE-2026-9256, CVE-2026-42055 and HTTP/2: Remote Denial of Service\n  via compression bomb and Slowloris-style attack\n\n[2:1.26.3-10]\n- Fixes CVE-2026-9256, CVE-2026-42055 and HTTP/2: Remote Denial of Service\n  via compression bomb and Slowloris-style attack\n\n[2:1.26.3-9]\n- Resolves: RHEL-176236 - nginx:1.26/nginx: NGINX:\n\n[2:1.26.3-8]\n- RHEL-157893 CVE-2026-32647 nginx: NGINX: Denial of Service or Code\n  Execution via specially crafted MP4 files\n\n[2:1.26.3-7]\n- RHEL-159452 CVE-2026-27651 nginx: NGINX: Denial of Service via\n  undisclosed requests when ngx_mail_auth_http_module is enabled\n\n[2:1.26.3-6]\n- RHEL-159544 - CVE-2026-27784 nginx: NGINX: Denial of Service due to\n  memory corruption via crafted MP4 file\n\n[2:1.26.3-5]\n- RHEL-159565 CVE-2026-27654 nginx: NGINX: Denial of Service or file\n  modification via buffer overflow in ngx_http_dav_module",
  "Platform": [
